flowchart LR
    Question["Runtime polymorphism"]

    Question --> Virtual["Virtual interface<br/>Base&"]
    Virtual --> Hidden["Derived types are not<br/>enumerated by the consumer"]
    Hidden --> VTable["vptr -> vtable slot<br/>-> concrete override"]
    VTable --> Erasure["Operational type erasure<br/>open implementation set"]

    Question --> Variant["std::variant&lt;A, B, C&gt;"]
    Variant --> Listed["A, B, and C remain explicit<br/>in the public type"]
    Listed --> Tagged["index() -> switch or table<br/>-> active alternative handler"]
    Tagged --> Closed["Closed tagged dispatch<br/>not type erasure"]
